---
layout: base.njk
permalink: "registration.html"
title: Registration
---
<main>
  <h2>Register for UX Day Graz 2027</h2>
  <p>Attendance is free, but registration is required because places are limited. Register now to save your seat.</p>

  <div class="info-grid">
    <div class="info-box">
      <h3>Deadline</h3>
      <p>Please register before 1 November 2027.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="info-box">
      <h3>Price</h3>
      <p>Free of charge. Lunch and coffee are included.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <form class="registration-form" action="thank-you.html" method="get">
    <label for="name">Full name</label>
    <input id="name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required>

    <label for="email">Email address</label>
    <input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required>

    <label for="ticket">I am attending as</label>
    <select id="ticket" name="ticket">
      <option>Student</option>
      <option>Professional</option>
      <option>Speaker or volunteer</option>
    </select>

    <label for="workshop">
      <input id="workshop" name="workshop" type="checkbox"> I would like to join the afternoon workshop
    </label>

    <button class="main-button" type="submit">Register now →</button>
  </form>
</main>
